---
import { client } from '../lib/microcms';

type News = {
  id: string;
  title: string;
  date: string;
  category: string;
  body: string;
};

const { contents: news } = await client.getList<News>({
  endpoint: 'news',
  queries: {
    limit: 3,
    orders: '-date',
  },
});

console.log('microCMS NEWS:', news);
---

<html lang="ja">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
  <title>AWA CYCLOCROSS</title>
  <meta
    name="description"
    content="徳島で開催される阿波シクロクロス。阿波の山と川を楽しむローカル・シクロクロス。"
  />
</head>

<body>
  <header class="header">
    <nav class="nav">
      <a class="brand" href="/">
        <span class="mark">AWA</span>
        <span>AWA CYCLOCROSS</span>
      </a>

      <div class="navlinks">
        <a href="#race">RACE</a>
        <a href="#news">NEWS</a>
        <a href="#about">ABOUT</a>
        <a href="#entry">ENTRY</a>
      </div>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <div>
        <div class="kicker">CYCLOCROSS / TOKUSHIMA</div>
        <h1>AWA<br />CX.</h1>
        <p>
          阿波の山と川、土と風。<br />
          徳島で走る、ローカル・シクロクロス。
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-art">
        <span class="hero-label">RIDE THE LAND</span>
        <div class="river"></div>
        <div class="terrain"></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="next" id="race">
      <div class="next-inner">
        <div>
          <small>NEXT RACE</small>
          <strong>AWA CYCLOCROSS 2026 / ROUND 01</strong>
        </div>

        <a class="cta" href="#entry">RACE INFO →</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="news">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2>NEWS</h2>
        <a class="more" href="/news">ALL NEWS →</a>
      </div>

      <div class="news">
        {news.map((item, index) => (
          <article class:list={["news-card", index === 0 && "feature"]}>
            <div>
              <span class="date">
  {new Date(item.date).toLocaleDateString('ja-JP', {
    timeZone: 'Asia/Tokyo',
    year: 'numeric',
    month: '2-digit',
    day: '2-digit',
  }).replaceAll('/', '.')}
</span>
              <span class="tag">{item.category}</span>
            </div>

<div class="news-title">
  <a href={`/news/${item.id}/`}>{item.title}</a>
</div>
</article>
))}
</div>
</section>

    <section class="section" id="entry">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2>RACE INFO</h2>
        <a class="more" href="#entry">DETAILS →</a>
      </div>

      <div class="info">
        <article class="info-card">
          <h3>ENTRY</h3>
          <p>
            カテゴリー、参加資格、エントリー方法など、
            大会参加に必要な情報。
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="info-card">
          <h3>COURSE</h3>
          <p>
            阿波の地形と季節のコンディションを活かした
            コースを紹介。
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="info-card">
          <h3>RESULT</h3>
          <p>
            レース終了後にリザルトを掲載。
            過去大会の記録もアーカイブ。
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="about">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2>ABOUT AWA</h2>
      </div>

      <p class="about-text">
        「AWA」は徳島のこと。吉野川の青、四国山地の緑、
        そして阿波の藍。土地の色をまとって、地域の人も
        遠くから来る人も、一緒に泥だらけになる。
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="footer">
    <div class="footer-inner">
      <div>
        <h2>AWA CYCLOCROSS</h2>
        <p>© 2026 AWA CYCLOCROSS</p>
      </div>

      <div class="footer-links">
        <a href="#">INSTAGRAM</a>
        <a href="#">FACEBOOK</a>
        <a href="#">CONTACT</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>

<style>
  :global(*) {
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  :global(html) {
    scroll-behavior: smooth;
  }

  :global(body) {
    margin: 0;
    background: #f5f3ec;
    color: #182124;
    font-family:
      Inter,
      -apple-system,
      BlinkMacSystemFont,
      "Hiragino Sans",
      "Yu Gothic",
      sans-serif;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  :global(a) {
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .header {
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    z-index: 20;
    background: rgba(245, 243, 236, 0.94);
    backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
    border-bottom: 1px solid #d8d9d2;
  }

  .nav {
    max-width: 1180px;
    margin: auto;
    padding: 18px 28px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }

  .brand {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  .mark {
    width: 38px;
    height: 38px;
    border: 2px solid #173f46;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    font-size: 11px;
  }

  .navlinks {
    display: flex;
    gap: 28px;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  .navlinks a:hover {
    color: #2f6f78;
  }

  .hero {
    max-width: 1180px;
    margin: auto;
    padding: 78px 28px 72px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.12fr 0.88fr;
    gap: 60px;
    align-items: end;
  }

  .kicker {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: 0.22em;
    color: #2f6f78;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }

  h1,
  h2,
  h3 {
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.02;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(64px, 9vw, 122px);
    letter-spacing: -0.07em;
    color: #173f46;
  }

  .hero p {
    max-width: 590px;
    color: #687476;
    font-size: 17px;
    margin: 24px 0 0;
  }

  .hero-art {
    min-height: 360px;
    position: relative;
    background: #173f46;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .hero-art::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background:
      linear-gradient(
        135deg,
        transparent 0 38%,
        rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08) 38% 39%,
        transparent 39% 52%,
        rgba(106, 128, 92, 0.85) 52% 54%,
        transparent 54%
      );
  }

  .terrain {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 0;
    left: -5%;
    width: 110%;
    height: 46%;
    background: #6a805c;
    clip-path: polygon(
      0 75%,
      13% 45%,
      24% 64%,
      38% 20%,
      50% 53%,
      65% 12%,
      77% 48%,
      90% 24%,
      100% 50%,
      100% 100%,
      0 100%
    );
  }

  .river {
    position: absolute;
    right: 8%;
    bottom: 0;
    width: 27%;
    height: 66%;
    background: #2f6f78;
    clip-path: polygon(
      58% 0,
      82% 0,
      72% 25%,
      100% 48%,
      76% 63%,
      83% 100%,
      52% 100%,
      44% 69%,
      0 55%,
      20% 39%,
      9% 19%,
      48% 27%
    );
  }

  .hero-label {
    position: absolute;
    left: 24px;
    top: 22px;
    color: white;
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    font-weight: 900;
  }

  .next {
    border-top: 1px solid #d8d9d2;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #d8d9d2;
    background: #ebeae2;
  }

  .next-inner {
    max-width: 1180px;
    margin: auto;
    padding: 28px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
    gap: 30px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .next small {
    display: block;
    color: #687476;
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    font-weight: 900;
  }

  .next strong {
    display: block;
    font-size: 30px;
    margin-top: 3px;
  }

  .cta {
    background: #173f46;
    color: white;
    padding: 14px 22px;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  }

  .section {
    max-width: 1180px;
    margin: auto;
    padding: 92px 28px;
  }

  .section-head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: end;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-bottom: 34px;
  }

  .section-head h2 {
    font-size: clamp(38px, 5vw, 62px);
    color: #173f46;
  }

  .more {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #173f46;
    padding-bottom: 4px;
  }

  .news {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.25fr 0.75fr;
    gap: 1px;
    background: #d8d9d2;
    border: 1px solid #d8d9d2;
  }

  .news-card {
    background: #f5f3ec;
    padding: 28px;
    min-height: 230px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }

  .news-card.feature {
    background: white;
  }

  .date {
    font-size: 11px;
    color: #687476;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    font-weight: 800;
  }

  .tag {
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    font-weight: 900;
    color: #2f6f78;
    margin-left: 10px;
  }

  .news-title {
    font-size: 25px;
    font-weight: 900;
    line-height: 1.25;
  }

  .info {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 14px;
  }

  .info-card {
    border-top: 3px solid #173f46;
    padding: 24px 0;
  }

  .info-card:nth-child(2) {
    border-color: #2f6f78;
  }

  .info-card:nth-child(3) {
    border-color: #6a805c;
  }

  .info-card h3 {
    font-size: 28px;
    color: #173f46;
  }

  .info-card p {
    color: #687476;
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  .about-text {
    max-width: 720px;
    font-size: 20px;
  }

  .footer {
    background: #173f46;
    color: white;
  }

  .footer-inner {
    max-width: 1180px;
    margin: auto;
    padding: 56px 28px 34px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 30px;
  }

  .footer h2 {
    font-size: 44px;
    letter-spacing: -0.05em;
  }

  .footer p {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.65);
    font-size: 12px;
  }

  .footer-links {
    display: flex;
    gap: 22px;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    align-items: end;
  }

  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .nav {
      padding: 14px 18px;
    }

    .navlinks {
      display: none;
    }

    .hero {
      padding: 48px 18px 40px;
      display: block;
    }

    .hero p {
      font-size: 15px;
    }

    .hero-art {
      margin-top: 34px;
      min-height: 250px;
    }

    .next-inner {
      padding: 22px 18px;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .next strong {
      font-size: 24px;
    }

    .section {
      padding: 62px 18px;
    }

    .section-head {
      display: block;
    }

    .more {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 16px;
    }

    .news {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .news-card {
      min-height: 190px;
    }

    .info {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .footer-inner {
      padding: 44px 18px 28px;
      display: block;
    }

    .footer-links {
      margin-top: 30px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
  }
</style>